# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the IBM Quantum Compute client from source {#install-the-ibm-quantum-compute-client-from-source}"
msgstr "Den IBM Quantum Compute-Client aus dem Quellcode installieren {#install-the-ibm-quantum-compute-client-from-source}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When you install `qiskit-ibm-runtime` from source, you can access the current development version, instead of using the version in the Python Package Index (PyPI) repository. You can therefore inspect and extend the latest version of the code more efficiently.\n"
msgstr "Wenn du `qiskit-ibm-runtime` aus dem Quellcode installierst, kannst du auf die aktuelle Entwicklungsversion zugreifen, anstatt die Version aus dem Python Package Index (PyPI) zu verwenden. So kannst du die neueste Version des Codes effizienter untersuchen und erweitern.\n"

